# autotest alpha.10 batch G (lane SC2, 2026-11-24). Written against the Feature text with sha 7f4b952882669728; honest subset only: what a screen or the guest shows is under clause, everything else under not-covered.
row: F-K8S-16
targets: qemu
profile: ram
feature-sha: 7f4b952882669728
doc: Settings, Clusters, Platform services panel is there (read only)
clause: 1 Settings, Clusters, P opens the Platform services panel that deploys services into a cluster the person chooses
